## Footer

The footer contains source notes and can be styled as a whole with `loc.footer()` or at the
individual source note level with `loc.source_notes()`.

::: {#2b4fda8d .cell execution_count=5}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(
    gt.tab_style(
        style.fill("yellow"),
        loc.source_notes(),
    ).tab_style(
        style.borders(weight="3px"),
        loc.footer(),
    )
)
```

